<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_a464d67e-a8fc-4491-81d6-3b23f7c42484"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d04db0ae-f72f-4f98-bec9-00bda6e49d9b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_77e36f8a-da6b-45a8-adbe-b64135f9ddcd"
id="sec.3-def.agriculturalactivity"><b><i>agricultural
activity</i></b></defterm> means an activity carried out for, or in connection
with, agriculture.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_72ce81b0-744e-4b6f-9721-cc97243f20ba"
id="sec.3-def.agriculture"><b><i>agriculture</i></b></defterm> includes
aquaculture and forestry.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_a04f21bb-a784-4575-966d-8ac857b5fce0"
id="sec.3-def.commercialagriculturalactivity"><b><i>commercial agricultural
activity</i></b></defterm> means an activity carried out for or in connection
with a primary production business within the meaning of the <legref
jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Income Tax
Assessment Act 1997</i></name></legref> of the
Commonwealth.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_5ce51e77-932e-43e9-a066-e3703e63cdff"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note"><heading guid="_581acf9f-5733-48de-b138-5b1b5746c6c6"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref refid="act-1987-015" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation Act
1987</i></name></legref> contains definitions and other provisions that affect
the interpretation and application of this Act.</txt></block></note>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a4186e65-90f0-4232-b930-aa59e4213385"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notes included in this Act do not form part of
this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_769769cd-fce9-425a-b65e-d68e5723d77b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_40a384f5-1ec4-43d1-9214-94ec959e15de"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Commercial agricultural activities do not constitute
nuisance</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">No action lies in respect of nuisance by reason
only of the carrying out of any of the following activities if the activity is
carried out lawfully and not negligently and that type of activity has been
carried out on the land for at least 12 months&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_cc3847ae-d64d-4ed2-b78a-fca89c6afe6c" id="sec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a commercial agricultural
activity,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_181134ba-79a9-4a1c-bb5d-66a97502eba8" id="sec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an activity carried out for the purposes of any
of the following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8edbb5e5-8524-4b8f-b095-2b696307d480" id="sec.4-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any business or undertaking in which cattle,
poultry, pigs, goats, horses, sheep or other livestock are kept or bred for
commercial purposes (for example, a dairy, saleyard or
feedlot),</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b6e26635-3152-4b10-a902-0a134276a936" id="sec.4-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a business or undertaking for the commercial
production of products derived from the slaughter of animals (including
poultry) or the processing of skins or wool of animals, including abattoirs,
knackeries, tanneries, woolscours and rendering plants,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9e668dd4-fd53-4cb2-acd2-3aebde38ba97" id="sec.4-para1.b-para2.iii">
<no>(iii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a business or undertaking for forestry (including
timber mills) or aquaculture,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_04047b0d-4629-4d2b-8f3f-28f08735ded0" id="sec.4-para1.b-para2.iv">
<no>(iv)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a show or competition involving livestock
(including a rodeo).</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f2ca16d0-7591-45ee-8abe-dbc0ed3618f2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_006f5815-45ad-400d-a0ee-865634b324da"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Courts to not order cessation of agricultural activity if
other order available</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a77cbcf1-9aed-4451-b5ea-1c5679845bce"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section applies if in proceedings a court
finds that a commercial agricultural activity carried out by a party to the
proceedings constitutes a nuisance.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_93c030fe-134c-4eed-bc21-0f53950fcf66"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The court must not order the complete cessation
of the commercial agricultural activity if the court is satisfied that it
could make an order that would permit the continuation of the activity in a
manner&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_56d971f4-f7d4-479b-bf41-b7f4d004ec63" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">that is managed, modified or reduced,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_592b4df0-e587-4c06-8255-194e350cad19" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">consistent with an efficient and commercially
viable agricultural operation, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_daf8b88c-a790-4208-a41f-a0810d4b4282" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">unlikely to significantly disturb the other party
to the proceedings.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cc80d4c6-5a45-426d-a990-e2aa37fca54a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (2) does not limit or otherwise
prejudice the power of a court to make any other order it thinks fit in
respect of the nuisance, including an order as to damages or
costs.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fed345f4-b64c-4316-9df5-8e41a217381a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_8f6871e8-bc96-4036-99a2-511bb1cba81a"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></level>
</content>


